OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, former hospital
OL,7,Fexecutives named in the report said
OL,8,Fthey were reviewing its findings and
OL,9,Frecommendations, but could not comment
OL,10,Ffurther while investigations remained
OL,11,Funder way.
